OL,3,A'Absolutely blown away': First visitors
OL,4,Asee Bayeux Tapestry as London
OL,5,Aexhibition opens
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Bayeux Tapestry tells the story of
OL,8,Fthe Norman conquest of England and the
OL,9,FBattle of Hastings in 1066 - five
OL,10,Fquestions you're too afraid to ask
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
