OL,3,ARoyal family rift after popular TV news
OL,4,Apresenter chosen to succeed Ugandan
OL,5,Aking
OL,6,
OL,7,FRoyal clan elders have named popular TV
OL,8,Fnews presenter Prince Edward Rukidi
OL,9,FKijanangoma, 56, as the next monarch,
OL,10,Fbut this has been rejected by Oyo's
OL,11,Fclose family.
OL,13,FHis sister, Princess Ruth Komuntale,
OL,14,Fsaid the late king had left a will
OL,15,Fwritten in 2022 naming his young son,
OL,16,Fwhose identity has never been
OL,17,Fdisclosed, as his successor.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
